      <!-- QUALITY ANALYSIS -->
      <h2 style="font-size:1.4rem;color:var(--ink);margin:2.5rem 0 1rem;padding-bottom:0.6rem;border-bottom:2px solid var(--border);">Where quality differs</h2>

      <h3 style="font-size:1.1rem;color:var(--ink);margin:1.5rem 0 0.75rem;font-family:'DM Serif Display',serif;">Physician depth</h3>
      <p class="prose" style="font-size:0.975rem;color:var(--ink-soft);line-height:1.85;margin-bottom:1.25rem;">Marek Health's MD-only model is a genuine differentiator. Every prescription is reviewed by a licensed physician who has chart-access and full authority to adjust your protocol. Defy Medical uses functional medicine doctors — they are real physicians, but the model is designed around health optimization as a system, not TRT as the primary focus. For men who want TRT as the core service with strong physician oversight, Marek is the safer bet.</p>

      <h3 style="font-size:1.1rem;color:var(--ink);margin:1.5rem 0 0.75rem;font-family:'DM Serif Display',serif;">Peptide therapy gap</h3>
      <p class="prose" style="font-size:0.975rem;color:var(--ink-soft);line-height:1.85;margin-bottom:1.25rem;">This is where Defy Medical has a real advantage — if you want peptide therapy. BPC-157 for gut healing, TB-500 for joint recovery, KLOW for fat loss and body composition. These are not part of Marek's standard menu. If you're interested in stacking peptides alongside your TRT protocol, Defy is the only option of the two worth considering.</p>

      <h3 style="font-size:1.1rem;color:var(--ink);margin:1.5rem 0 0.75rem;font-family:'DM Serif Display',serif;">Cost-per-value ratio</h3>
      <p class="prose" style="font-size:0.975rem;color:var(--ink-soft);line-height:1.85;margin-bottom:1.25rem;">At $195/mo, Defy Medical costs $660/year more than Marek Health. For that premium you get peptide access and a functional-medicine framing. Whether that justify the cost depends on your goals. If you don't care about peptides, you're paying $660 extra per year for a different philosophy — not better outcomes.</p>

