      <!-- BOTH LOSE TO TRT NATION -->
      <div class="note-box">
        <div class="note-box-label">Worth noting</div>
        <p>If pure value is your goal, both Marek and Defy lose to <a href="/reviews/trt-nation" class="text-link">TRT Nation at $99/mo</a>. For $41–$96 less per month, you get a higher score (9.1 vs 8.0/7.7), unlimited consults, and a broader medication menu. Marek and Defy make sense when you need something those clinics don't offer — MD-only physician oversight (Marek) or peptide access (Defy).</p>
      </div>

